html='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>BOF pursuit highlights - Rough Riders</title><style>body{max-width:1000px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 20px;background:#0b1420;color:#f5ecda;font:17px/1.5 system-ui}img{max-width:100%;height:auto;image-rendering:pixelated}a{color:#8ce5bc}section{margin:32px 0}p{max-width:850px}</style><h1>Choose your pursuit</h1><p>Actual native menus with authored16-frame green selector animation. Real left/right keyboard input; existing confirm routes remain unchanged. Hard first, then Furious in the combined GIF.</p><section><img id="combined" src="pursuit-highlights.gif" alt="Hard then Furious pursuit screens, highlighting left and right choices"><p><a href="pursuit-highlights.gif">Combined8-second GIF</a></p></section><section><h2>Hard: Harrier or Rough Riders</h2><img id="hard" src="pursuit-hard-highlight.gif" alt="Hard pursuit selection"></section><section><h2>Furious: Storm Cannon or Rough Riders</h2><img id="furious" src="pursuit-furious-highlight.gif" alt="Furious pursuit selection"></section><p>All current dialogue uses Rough Riders. Individual pilot names and legacy save/encounter/password identifiers remain stable. The album is Bulletalica.</p><p><a href="../../docs/ROUGH_RIDERS_SELECTION_1115.md">Change report and verification</a></p></html>'''
